  "details": "I think it's wrong programmed or there is bad code by converting to new VRChat version.\n\nFirst screenshot showed the line thickness is overall SAME. Just perfect. The writing is good readable.\n\nNow, after new VRChat upgrade to 2018.4.3 (2017 version) something is wrong.\nThe line thickness is now variable, the thickness changed very much and that makes the text more unreadable.\n\nAlso lines are bad connected together in new update. The old version is much better and more \"stabilized\" between first and second shot.\n\nEven in line mess in 3rd shot, you can see lines are different.\n\nThis is cleary wrong upgrade. I want back to more stable lines in old version. Because now it reading text more harder, and will more bad if you have low fps or lag.\n\nThe nice lines made in drawings like in 4th shot will not more seen, it will more messed up now.\n\nI cannot approve the new Presentation Room upgrade. What is going on here?",
